webForCore
==========

webForCore is a fork of WebFormsForCore (https://github.com/webformsforcore/WebFormsForCore, commit 52f4172),
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE). This file lists every third-party component in this repository, where
it came from, its licence and its copyright holders. Licence texts: LICENSE (MIT), LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt (Apache
License 2.0), LICENSE-BSD-3-CLAUSE.txt (BSD 3-Clause). Every source file keeps its original header.

A plain-language summary, including commercial use, is in docs/LICENSING.md.

