System.Web.Extensions, System.Web.Services, System.Web.Mobile, System.Web.DataVisualization, System.Web.DynamicData,
System.Web.Entity and aspnet_compiler, taken through WebFormsForCore's fork of it
(https://github.com/simonegli8/WebFormsCoreReferenceSource). The files keep Microsoft's headers.

