Code taken from the ASP.NET Web Stack lives in the src/ and test/ directories listed for it in the summary above.
Each file keeps its original copyright header. Files were copied with line endings normalised to CRLF; every other
change is listed in docs/lifted-changes.md and LIFT.md, and the per-file source of each copy is recorded in
tools/lift/manifests/.

The assemblies built from that code are delay signed with Microsoft's public key
(src/SigningKey/35MSSharedLib1024.snk, from the ASP.NET Web Stack repository), so that their
identity matches the assemblies Microsoft ships. They are not signed by Microsoft.

This product includes software from Katana (https://github.com/aspnet/AspNetKatana, commit 096e225), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt), with the same notice as above. It lives in
src/webForCore.Microsoft.Owin* and test/webForCore.Microsoft.Owin*; each file keeps its original copyright header
and was copied unchanged (Katana's files are LF). Every change is listed in LIFT.md, and the per-file source is
recorded in tools/lift/manifests/. Those assemblies are delay signed with the same Microsoft public key and carry
Microsoft.Owin's version 4.2.3.0. Files under tools/lift/additions/ are webForCore's own and say so in their header.

This product includes tests from Mono (https://github.com/mono/mono, mcs/class/System.Web/Test and
mcs/class/test-helpers, commit 0f53e9e), licensed under the MIT License. Each file keeps its original copyright
